          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "line1": "<span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">In 2016 Hana received an advanced scoliosis diagnosis, a condition that occurs more often in females than males.<sup>1</sup> After seeing how her healthcare team supported her throughout surgery and during rehabilitation, she realizes that she also wants to help patients live healthier lives.</span>",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 25 2021 18:02:23 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/largeheadline",
